OL,3,ANine Zimbabweans caught allegedly
OL,4,Atrying to leave South Africa to fight
OL,5,Ain Ukraine
OL,6,
OL,7,FThey have been charged with
OL,8,Fcontravening South Africa's Regulation
OL,9,Fof Foreign Military Assistance Act,
OL,10,Fwhich outlaws mercenary activity
OL,11,Fwithout government permission.
